---
description: Postgres schema and migration conventions.
globs: apps/api/drizzle/**,apps/api/src/infra/db/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow `.claude/skills/db-migration/SKILL.md`.

- Migrations are hand-written SQL. `drizzle-kit` is not used, because Drizzle
  cannot express `EXCLUDE USING gist`. Separate statements with
  `--> statement-breakpoint` and add an entry to `drizzle/meta/_journal.json`.
- `drizzle/0000_initial.sql` is authoritative. `src/infra/db/schema.ts` exists
  only to type queries and follows the SQL, never the reverse.
- Intervals are `tstzrange`, half-open `[start, end)`. Never a start/end pair.
- Index expressions must be IMMUTABLE — `timestamptz::date` is not.
- Forward-only, with a matching down script under `drizzle/down/`.
